WEBVTT

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:03.773
1

00:00:04.725 --> 00:00:07.453
<b>I can</b> sing, but <b>I can’t</b> dance.

00:00:09.453 --> 00:00:10.093
2

00:00:11.165 --> 00:00:15.253
<b>I can</b> come on Tuesday, but <b>I can’t</b> come on Wednesday.

00:00:17.229 --> 00:00:17.859
3

00:00:18.981 --> 00:00:22.179
<b>You can</b> park here. <b>You can’t</b> park there.

00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:24.619
4

00:00:25.529 --> 00:00:28.713
<b>Can you</b> help me? <b>Can I</b> open the window?